                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7e0aa3a8-0dec-3e2c-b935-3200964725c8",
                        "entry_id": "daab300c-a78b-353b-9aa6-476ad145a89a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Appareil conçu pour évoluer dans l’espace."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "57298f54-d53a-468a-8bf3-0365e0f10458",
                                "sense_id": "7e0aa3a8-0dec-3e2c-b935-3200964725c8",
                                "text": "Le jour qui a suivi la dernière visite de Gosh, l’astronef, que tout le monde croyait loin de la Terre, est revenu avec ses étincelles bleutées et ce grésillement qui hérissait nos poils et rendait les oiseaux muets."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a150d7d5-88a5-480f-9efd-4f28f214eecb",
                        "source_entry_id": "daab300c-a78b-353b-9aa6-476ad145a89a",
                        "source_sense_id": "7e0aa3a8-0dec-3e2c-b935-3200964725c8",
                        "target_lang_word": "spaceship",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "spaceship",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b779921e-4997-302d-84d5-60c6967d5f1d",
                                        "entry_id": "508a50b3-3e89-3ae9-87db-01364bf1333f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A manned vehicle that flies through space."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dafd812a-bd73-30f1-be16-05629dee1cb2",
                                        "entry_id": "508a50b3-3e89-3ae9-87db-01364bf1333f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A finite pattern that reappears after a certain number of generations in the same orientation but in a different position."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "065911ed-2cc3-46af-98de-42de8c9b8f76",
                                                "sense_id": "dafd812a-bd73-30f1-be16-05629dee1cb2",
                                                "text": "The spaceships look like a row of threshers harvesting a field of wheat; the thickness in the direction of motion is only about 10 cells."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73fb7527-15d6-4a64-b117-b294b0edf6f8",
                                                "sense_id": "dafd812a-bd73-30f1-be16-05629dee1cb2",
                                                "text": "We describe software that searches for spaceships in Conway's Game of Life and related two-dimensional cellular automata."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f9febb7-b1e1-4a95-8de3-0ed6865ac410",
                                                "sense_id": "dafd812a-bd73-30f1-be16-05629dee1cb2",
                                                "text": "Synthesis of spaceship flotillas is even more complicated than synthesis of oscillators, since spaceships are like oscillators that move[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13eb43ad-31d1-31f7-b751-71a1b1485486",
                                        "entry_id": "508a50b3-3e89-3ae9-87db-01364bf1333f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The operator <=> in certain programming languages, which compares two values and indicates whether the first is lesser than, greater than, or equal to the second."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e3810e4-fa4c-43e3-bf19-5197ef655f03",
                                                "sense_id": "13eb43ad-31d1-31f7-b751-71a1b1485486",
                                                "text": "If we reverse the positions of $a and $b, the spaceship will sort in the opposite order[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc497668-df70-3456-af2b-8054afc79212",
                                        "entry_id": "508a50b3-3e89-3ae9-87db-01364bf1333f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A computer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "95d92e67-cbb2-4d57-911a-030a2e52a5e6",
                        "source_entry_id": "daab300c-a78b-353b-9aa6-476ad145a89a",
                        "source_sense_id": "7e0aa3a8-0dec-3e2c-b935-3200964725c8",
                        "target_lang_word": "spacecraft",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "spacecraft",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8b15263-af9f-397d-a503-4b0a0d8d3e09",
                                        "entry_id": "f4a4d670-5aae-36be-8176-5f7ee2618f1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A vehicle that travels through space."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c44d6d87-d125-4eb4-9792-65149f520795",
                                                "sense_id": "e8b15263-af9f-397d-a503-4b0a0d8d3e09",
                                                "text": "Today, Velcro is used for everything from keeping astronauts from floating off the floor of their spacecrafts to keeping artificial hearts in place, as well as the more mundane tasks of fastening clothing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "745e3f2c-c4ff-410a-a4b5-c82beb557ac7",
                                                "sense_id": "e8b15263-af9f-397d-a503-4b0a0d8d3e09",
                                                "text": "The object appeared after a series of routine prelanding procedures in which the crew tested the steering jets, a test that often shakes loose objects from the spacecraft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1da73295-0823-4bce-8388-34d54d87c217",
                                                "sense_id": "e8b15263-af9f-397d-a503-4b0a0d8d3e09",
                                                "text": "For the autocompatibility test, completed with Redwire partner Airbus Defense and Space, both spacecraft were stacked together, just like they will be for launch and the first month of the mission."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2614d8b5-5264-44cf-93c6-fde3aa60afa6",
